    "name": "Emergency Cleanup Co.",
    "steam_appid": 2413190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/1680023e1f88df2e2b7bf0a880233128.poster.avif?t=1755004731\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/1680023e1f88df2e2b7bf0a880233128.webm?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/1680023e1f88df2e2b7bf0a880233128.mp4?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tYou've inherited the family cleaning business, and now it\u2019s your turn to carry the vacuum and the mission. Take on cleaning jobs in a variety of unique locations, from cozy homes and messy art galleries to space stations and sunny beaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/666c589c3f72a65bc50416ca4d98125e.poster.avif?t=1755004731\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/666c589c3f72a65bc50416ca4d98125e.webm?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/666c589c3f72a65bc50416ca4d98125e.mp4?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tScrub dirt, wash stains, and bring order to chaos using sponges, vacuums, steam cleaners, and the all-new pressure washer. Complete jobs to earn money and unlock new tools to expand your cleaning arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/65d4a2dab0316caa639e82c9c69bbe93.poster.avif?t=1755004731\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/65d4a2dab0316caa639e82c9c69bbe93.webm?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/65d4a2dab0316caa639e82c9c69bbe93.mp4?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tCustomize your gear with different gloves, trash cans, and more. Whether you prefer a sleek and clean look or a colorful mess, make the job yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/e72f0cb80185a9ea3ce94a1aa9d41dac.poster.avif?t=1755004731\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/e72f0cb80185a9ea3ce94a1aa9d41dac.webm?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/e72f0cb80185a9ea3ce94a1aa9d41dac.mp4?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tNo rush, no stress \u2014 just you, your tools, and a mess to turn into perfection. Play at your own pace and enjoy the oddly satisfying joy of cleaning. And if you\u2019re feeling competitive, try to top the leaderboard by finishing jobs with maximum efficiency.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/1680023e1f88df2e2b7bf0a880233128.poster.avif?t=1755004731\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/1680023e1f88df2e2b7bf0a880233128.webm?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/1680023e1f88df2e2b7bf0a880233128.mp4?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tYou've inherited the family cleaning business, and now it\u2019s your turn to carry the vacuum and the mission. Take on cleaning jobs in a variety of unique locations, from cozy homes and messy art galleries to space stations and sunny beaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/666c589c3f72a65bc50416ca4d98125e.poster.avif?t=1755004731\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/666c589c3f72a65bc50416ca4d98125e.webm?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/666c589c3f72a65bc50416ca4d98125e.mp4?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tScrub dirt, wash stains, and bring order to chaos using sponges, vacuums, steam cleaners, and the all-new pressure washer. Complete jobs to earn money and unlock new tools to expand your cleaning arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/65d4a2dab0316caa639e82c9c69bbe93.poster.avif?t=1755004731\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/65d4a2dab0316caa639e82c9c69bbe93.webm?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/65d4a2dab0316caa639e82c9c69bbe93.mp4?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tCustomize your gear with different gloves, trash cans, and more. Whether you prefer a sleek and clean look or a colorful mess, make the job yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/e72f0cb80185a9ea3ce94a1aa9d41dac.poster.avif?t=1755004731\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/e72f0cb80185a9ea3ce94a1aa9d41dac.webm?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/e72f0cb80185a9ea3ce94a1aa9d41dac.mp4?t=1755004731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tNo rush, no stress \u2014 just you, your tools, and a mess to turn into perfection. Play at your own pace and enjoy the oddly satisfying joy of cleaning. And if you\u2019re feeling competitive, try to top the leaderboard by finishing jobs with maximum efficiency.</p>",
    "short_description": "Clean where chaos reigns. From filthy homes and cluttered offices to messy beaches and space stations, clear trash, scrape grime, and tidy up. Blast away dirt with high-pressure water, upgrade your tools, and restore order. Don\u2019t keep your clients waiting, get to work!",
